--- query
UNWIND [1,1] AS x MATCH (a:person) WHERE a.ID < 3 MATCH (b:person) WHERE b.ID < 6 AND b.ID > 2 WITH a, COLLECT(DISTINCT b) AS bs UNWIND bs AS newB RETURN a.fName, newB.fName
--- expected
Alice|Carol
Alice|Dan
Bob|Carol
Bob|Dan
